# Jak 1's title Multiplayer (LIST-0.1.6 item 22; the owner: a Multiplayer section "in the main menu of the games",
# "like the openrac multiplayer mod"). Start opens the title menu, the right hand pointing away (hand_pitch 70); the
# left stick down twice (New Game, Load Game, Multiplayer) and A: the VR menu should open on its Multiplayer page
# (log "[vr-menu] open Multiplayer (the title's Multiplayer)"; shot tm-page). The stick down twice (Multiplayer, Your
# game, Host a game) and A: Host which save?, with no "This game as it is" at the title (tm-host). B: back to
# Multiplayer (tm-back). B: closed, the title menu still up (tm-title2). Then the stick up twice and A on New Game:
# a new game starts as ever (tm-new), the multiplayer mod untouched (no party line in the log).
